      "role": "user",
      "content": "exactly. it feels like i'm just performing a role for people who don't even see me. even when i'm around others, i feel miles away. it's like there's this heavy weight that never goes away, and i'm just... done with the effort. what's the point of trying to bridge a gap that's just too big?",
